      k frame payload sourcePost restored result bs bsPost n nPost compiled lens
      ⟨sourceContinuation,notError,restoredRelation,retConventions,retFlat,compilation,
        lengthBound,restoredBitmapBound,restoredBitmapPrefix,restoredLabels,retMax⟩ bndSize contCode
  change extraClock + (S + 1) * sourcePost.clock ≤ (S + 1) * popped.clock + wsize retCode at bndCont
  rw [popClock] at bndCont
